# GoldenPixel needs NO environment variables. Everything below is optional and PUBLIC (it is bundled into the site).
# Never put secrets in VITE_ variables. GoldenPixel needs no private keys, seed phrases or API secrets.

# Override the receiving wallet (default: PAYMENT_RECIPIENT in src/config/payments.ts).
# VITE_PAYMENT_RECIPIENT=0x...

# Your own Arc RPC endpoint for reading payments from the chain (default: the public RPC in the chain registry).
# VITE_PAYMENT_RPC_URL=https://...
